\9if root == workInProgressRoot then\
\9\9-- Received an update to a tree that's in the middle of rendering. Mark\
\9\9-- that there was an interleaved update work on this root. Unless the\
\9\9-- `ReactFeatureFlags.deferRenderPhaseUpdateToNextBatch` flag is off and this is a render\
\9\9-- phase update. In that case, we don't treat render phase updates as if\
\9\9-- they were interleaved, for backwards compat reasons.\
