\9\9\9-- definitely won't finish. Since we have a new update, let's mark it as\
\9\9\9-- suspended now, right before marking the incoming update. This has the\
\9\9\9-- effect of interrupting the current render and switching to the update.\
\9\9\9-- TODO: Make sure this doesn't override pings that happen while we've\
\9\9\9-- already started rendering.\
\9\9\9mod.markRootSuspended(root, workInProgressRootRenderLanes)\
\9\9end\
\9end\
