\9\9\9if executionContext == NoContext then\
\9\9\9\9-- Flush the synchronous work now, unless we're already working or inside\
\9\9\9\9-- a batch. This is intentionally inside scheduleUpdateOnFiber instead of\
\9\9\9\9-- scheduleCallbackForFiber to preserve the ability to schedule a callback\
\9\9\9\9-- without immediately flushing it. We only do this for user-initiated\
\9\9\9\9-- updates, to preserve historical behavior of legacy mode.\
