\9-- We use this when assigning a lane for a transition inside\
\9-- `requestUpdateLane`. We assume it's the same as the root being updated,\
\9-- since in the common case of a single root app it probably is. If it's not\
\9-- the same root, then it's not a huge deal, we just might batch more stuff\
\9-- together more than necessary.\
\9mostRecentlyUpdatedRoot = root\
\9return root\
