\9\9(1 second passes)\
\9\9> 1) Got foo!\
\9\9(1 second passes)\
\9\9> 2) Got bar!\
\9\9(1 second passes)\
\9\9> 3) Got baz!\
\9\9(1 second passes)\
\9\9> 4) Got qux!\
\9]]\
